              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 32.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi bombaakhe abuundu aesuta khu sikulu sia Tofeti siili mwitooma lia okhwa Hinomu. Benya khukhwoseliao babaana babwe basoleeli ne bakhaana. Lilienelio ese se nabalaka namwe liechakho mu mebaasio kase tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Khwako lola chindaalo chilikho chiicha, se lulilaangwa lundi bali ‘Tofeti’ namwe ‘Litooma lia okhwa Hinomu’ tawe, ne kakhali likhalaangwe ‘Litooma lie Lifwa’ sikila balisiikhamo Tofeti, ne bubwangu se bukhasikalekho abuundu aandi osi osi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bafu baliba siakhulia sie chinyuni ne chisolo ne se aliio omundu olichirisiarisia chilukhe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
